== History ==
At [[the Professor's castle]], Lightcoat was used by [[Sophie Casterwill]] to protect [[Sabriel]] against [[Zhalia Moon]]'s [[King Basilisk]] while fighting about [[Dante Vale]]'s choice to hand the [[Legendary Titans]] over to [[Simon Judeau]]. Though the shield was able to protect against King Basilisk's Stonegaze power, Zhalia's Titan was still able to destroy the shield to defeat Sabriel. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

This spell subsequently was used by [[Sophie Casterwill]] to protect [[Sabriel]] against Simon's [[Nordrake]] during the ritual of the Legendary Titans. {{source|The Mission}}
